# CORE_UX — encapsulation

**This repo = generic UI kit.** Presentation only — no `$svc('ajax')`, no domain logic.

- Kit UI → **CORE_UX** | JS platform → **CORE_JS** | PHP platform → **CORE_PHP** | Product → **consuming app**
- Rules/skills for `<core-*>`, tokens, theming → **this repo**
- Docs use **local paths only** — must work standalone and when symlinked

Details: `ai-instructions/layering.md`, `ai-instructions/encapsulation.md`.
